The appropriate implementation depends on:

* number of accounts
* browser requirements
* persistence requirements
* infrastructure
* automation framework
* security requirements
* platform-specific behavior

For teams that do not want to build every browser-management component themselves, specialized automation platforms can provide some of this infrastructure as part of a larger workflow.

